SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=# ANON_KEY from supabase
SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=# SERVICE_ROLE_KEY from supabase
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.<tenant>:<password>@localhost:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true&sslmode=verify-ca&sslrootcert=server.crt" # replace <tenant> and <password> with values from supbase setup. Add following parameters for ssl support and follow the instructions in the supabase repository to generate the certificate: sslmode=verify-ca&sslrootcert=server.crt
DATABASE_DIRECT_URL="postgresql://postgres.<tenant>:<password>@localhost:5432/postgres?sslmode=verify-ca&sslrootcert=server.crt" # replace <tenant> and <password> with values from supabase setup. Add following parameters for ssl support and follow the instructions in the supabase repository to generate the certificate: sslmode=verify-ca&sslrootcert=server.crt